331+  A08E AF                   xor a
332+  A08F 32 0F 9B             ld (POSICION+1), a      ; nothing pending
333+  A092 C3 10 9B             jp dibujarpala          ; ...and draw it at the centre now, so the paddle does
334+  A095                                              ; not blink out for a frame between erase and redraw
335+  A095
336+  A095              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
337+  A095              ; reset_game - everything a brand-new game needs, including the bytes the loader only
338+  A095              ;   ever initialises once.
339+  A095              ;   Clobbers AF, HL.
340+  A095              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
